# Fixture: a step no class can finish (tests/playtest.test.js): its goto is
# on a map the game has no frame for, so the player can never arrive.
guide stuck/northshire
title Stuck Fixture
faction Alliance
race Human
levels 1-6
zone Elwynn Forest

